{{Term/Store|Thundra Plateau||Series, BotW, TotK, AoC}} is a recurring location in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''Thundra Plateau'''|Map|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Thundra Plateau'''|Map|TotK}}</ref><ref name="AoC Gallery"/>

{{OTOC}}

==Features and Overview==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Thundra Plateau is located within [[Ludfo's Bog]] on [[Hyrule Ridge]]. The Plateau features a variety of [[Zonai Ruin]]s, including pillars and [[Dragon]]-head statues.<ref>{{Cite Book|book= CaC|page= 412}}</ref> It is known for the frequency at which [[Lightning]] and [[Thunderstorm]]s appear in the area.<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= CaC |publisher= |page= 226}}</ref> When [[Link]] first arrives at the Plateau, it will be constantly under the effects of a Thunderstorm, which can be observed from a distance.

As Link approaches Thundra Plateau, he will hear the voice of [[Toh Yahsa]], who instructs him to return the "four spirits" to their proper places to reveal an [[Ancient Shrine]].<ref>{{Cite|{{Color BotW|Monk Blue|You who have reached this land of thunder, I present you with a trial. When the four spirits have been settled in their proper places, they will guide you to the hero's trial.}}|Toh Yahsa|BotW}}</ref> This starts the "[[Trial of Thunder]]" [[Shrine Quest]]. Throughout Thundra Plateau and in the surrounding area, Link can find four colorful orbs, which he must place in the four corresponding slots on the Plateau. Once all four orbs have been placed in their slots, [[Toh Yahsa Shrine]] will rise from the ground at the center of the Plateau, completing the Shrine Quest.<ref>{{Cite|You set the four spirits in their proper places based on the diagrams on the stone pillars.<br/><br/>When this was done, a shrine appeared in the middle on the Thundra Plateau!|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

