==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
As part of the "[[Preparing for Field Work]]" [[Quest]], [[Zelda]] wishes to investigate an ancient relic that has been discovered on Thundra Plateau, but she needs [[Material]]s to help protect her from [[Electricity]].<ref name="AoC Gallery"/> After receiving the Materials, however, Zelda is unable to learn anything from the relic.<ref name="AoC Gallery 2"/>

During the "[[Stealth Mission]]" Quest, [[Urbosa]] needs Materials to keep her hidden while she investigates rumors of a [[Monster]] horde on Thundra Plateau.<ref name="AoC Gallery 3/> With the Materials, she determines that the shadows from [[Lightning]] strikes made there seem to be more Monsters than were actually present.<ref name="AoC Gallery 4"/>

As part of the "[[Beyond the Wall of Thunder]]" Quest, a [[Rito]] Monster hunter needs Electricity-resistant Materials so she can face the Monsters on Thundra Plateau.<ref name="AoC Gallery 5"/> Once she receives the Materials, she is able to reduce the number of Monsters residing on Thundra Plateau.<ref name="AoC Gallery 6"/>

As part of the "[[EX Master Kohga's Lightning Training]]" Quest, [[Master Kohga]] attempts to dodge strikes of [[Lightning]] on Thundra Plateau as training to become a stronger fighter.<ref name="AoC Gallery 7/> The training helps increase his speed, allowing him to run a lap around the Plateau without being struck.<ref name="AoC Gallery 8"/>
{{Noncanon|End}}

